     1	= ERC-20 Wrapper
     2	
     3	Extension of the ERC-20 token contract to support token wrapping.
     4	
     5	Users can deposit and withdraw "underlying tokens" and receive a matching number of "wrapped tokens".
     6	This is useful in conjunction with other modules.
